# T-977: Constructor equality — same qualified tag compares equal, different tags compare unequal.
# values_equal on Variant{payload: None} compares tag strings directly.
# Color.Red == Color.Red is true; Color.Red == Color.Green is false.
# Uses qualified names (T-1086: [type ...] evaluates to constructor dict; bare Red not in scope).
[
  Color:   [type Red Green Blue]
  eq-same: [= Color.Red Color.Red]
  eq-diff: [= Color.Red Color.Green]
]
=== out
Dict({"Color": Dict({"Red": Variant(Color.Red, Null), "Green": Variant(Color.Green, Null), "Blue": Variant(Color.Blue, Null)}), "eq-same": Bool(true), "eq-diff": Bool(false)})
